    {
      "end": "00:02:22.600",
      "start": "00:02:19.600",
      "text": " Yep, that's what it is."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:27.600",
      "start": "00:02:22.600",
      "text": " Got it with my shovel there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:30.600",
      "start": "00:02:27.600",
      "text": " I haven't really got any good targets in the last half hour so,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:34.600",
      "start": "00:02:30.600",
      "text": " but I just got a weep pin in about 4-5 inches deep."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:43.600",
      "start": "00:02:34.600",
      "text": " That's about it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:47.600",
      "start": "00:02:43.600",
      "text": " That one's reading 28-29 with about 3 bars on the depth meter."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:54.600",
      "start": "00:02:47.600",
      "text": " That could be a silver dime."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:01.600",
      "start": "00:02:54.600",
      "text": " See if I can't hold the phone in one hand and do a live dig."
