      "text": " I'm going to have to go back to the other side."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:48.600",
      "start": "00:03:39.600",
      "text": " There we go."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:52.600",
      "start": "00:03:48.600",
      "text": " It is a silver."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:01.600",
      "start": "00:03:52.600",
      "text": " Looks like it's going to be a mercury dime."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:02.600",
      "start": "00:04:01.600",
      "text": " It'll focus there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:04.600",
      "start": "00:04:02.600",
      "text": " Maybe you can see a date."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:11.600",
      "start": "00:04:04.600",
      "text": " If not, we'll get one off of it later."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:14.600",
      "start": "00:04:11.600",
      "text": " I just got that one on a 22 signal."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:16.600",
      "start": "00:04:14.600",
      "text": " I'll ring up kind of like a copper penny."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:19.600",
      "start": "00:04:16.600",
      "text": " Looks like it's got an eagle on that side."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:22.600",
      "start": "00:04:19.600",
      "text": " And then on the other side, it looks like it says no cash value."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:24.600",
      "start": "00:04:22.600",
      "text": " So, some kind of token."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:33.600",
      "start": "00:04:24.600",
      "text": " We'll get it cleaned up and get a better look at it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:40.600",
      "start": "00:04:34.600",
      "text": " Let's get a listen to this one before I dig it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:51.600",
      "start": "00:04:40.600",
      "text": " It's about some between 17 and 23, but what I like about it is the depth is about some between 3 and 4 arrows."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:56.600",
      "start": "00:04:51.600",
      "text": " So, 6 to 8 inches deep."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:59.600",
      "start": "00:04:56.600",
      "text": " Dig it up and see what it is."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:02.600",
      "start": "00:04:59.600",
      "text": " That one turned out to be an Indian headpinny."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:06.600",
      "start": "00:05:02.600",
      "text": " I believe the date is a 1907, but I'm not sure about that."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:15.600",
      "start": "00:05:06.600",
      "text": " Anyway, it was about 6 or 7 inches down."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:19.600",
      "start": "00:05:15.600",
      "text": " Just eyeballed a gold earring on top of the ground there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:23.600",
      "start": "00:05:19.600",
      "text": " I'm sure it's just plated."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:26.600",
      "start": "00:05:23.600",
      "text": " Yeah, it's too light to be anything but plated."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:31.600",
      "start": "00:05:26.600",
      "text": " Anyway, there's a jumpy signal in the mid-30s."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:39.600",
      "start": "00:05:31.600",
      "text": " It's bouncing around a little bit, but most of the really clean signals are going around here."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:42.600",
      "start": "00:05:39.600",
      "text": " So, I'll dig it up and give it a look."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:44.600",
      "start": "00:05:42.600",
      "text": " And it's about 6 inches down."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:48.600",
      "start": "00:05:44.600",
      "text": " That one turned out to be some kind of religious coin or token."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:54.600",
      "start": "00:05:48.600",
      "text": " I can't really make out what it says right now, but I'll put up a picture for you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:07.600",
      "start": "00:05:54.600",
      "text": " It's got kind of a loud 26 signal right there, and I thought it was going to be a piece of junk or a can or something, but that's what popped out."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:13.600",
      "start": "00:06:07.600",
      "text": " I can't make out what's on there, but it looks like some kind of figure or something."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:17.600",
      "start": "00:06:13.600",
      "text": " I don't know if we get it cleaned up and get a better look at it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:30.600",
      "start": "00:06:17.600",
      "text": " Just got a 26-27 signal right there, and about 6 inches down, I popped that out."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:36.600",
      "start": "00:06:30.600",
      "text": " I first thought it was a drawer pull, but I can't see any attachment point on either side, so I'm not really sure."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:43.600",
      "start": "00:06:36.600",
      "text": " It's heavy. It feels like it's made out of lead, so I'm not really sure about that one."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:06:57.600",
      "start": "00:06:47.600",
      "text": " That one's reading 3031, but only two arrows on the depth meter, so it could just be a cloud quarter."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:07:21.600",
      "start": "00:07:18.600",
      "text": " Hey, this is how we got a silver ring."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:07:26.600",
      "start": "00:07:21.600",
      "text": " Pretty sure that silver's got some weight to it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:08:10.600",
      "start": "00:07:48.600",
      "text": " I can't tell what if there's a mark in there or not, but we'll get it cleaned up and get a better look at it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:08:13.600",
      "start": "00:08:10.600",
      "text": " I'm about 99% positive, less silver."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:08:15.600",
      "start": "00:08:13.600",
      "text": " Awesome."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:08:22.600",
